From 3e66df434927f063fa9b07476c214b6c7ce62749 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AlexProgrammerDE <40795980+AlexProgrammerDE@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 10:44:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(bedrock): render Character Creator geometry and face
 animations

Character Creator skins can split the body and animated face into separate geometry models and textures. Parse the bound models together, validate their layout, and render the face as a synchronized layer. Keep a visible vanilla fallback for unsupported geometry and animation data instead of installing a blank renderer.
